# The control-plane image uses repository-root context for the shared protocol.
# Keep local secrets, Git data, the dashboard, and build output out of that context.
**
!services/
!services/control-plane/
!services/control-plane/**
!proto/
!proto/**
services/control-plane/.gradle
services/control-plane/build
services/control-plane/hs_err_*
services/control-plane/*.log
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/node_modules
